        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Are you weary of your ordinary life?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Do you desire a moment bathed in the warm glow of the spotlight?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dear friend, we have heard your voice!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-178d4b62d19b5a6a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Now, Starmaker Agency will roll out the red carpet just for you..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-cf3ce94542c1fe2b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "We cordially invite you to subscribe to the \"Immersive Superstar Experience Service\""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Here, fame goes beyond just 15 minutes!"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f9ab999198eb63a6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Starmaker Agency firmly believes in \"creating fame for those who have none.\""
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "We are dedicated to shattering the 15-minute rule, turning 15 minutes of fame into another 15 minutes again and again!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-6729acaed76c3490"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Starmaker Agency offers the following tiered dream-fulfillment packages:"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-b73467d18205ad31"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Lite Experience | 1-Day Celebrity Experience | 88,000 Credits Only"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5a5832fdf6a13018"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Exclusive Styling Team: Carries out your head-to-toe transformation into a star"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-cf8367e853981b8f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hype Squad: Supports in-person yelling and hype atmosphere at designated locations, but upholds a strict zero tolerance policy against toxic fans"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f4f5d94673e86947"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Public Opinion Simulation Team:"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "50 genuine alt-accounts to slide into your DMs"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "50 genuine alt-accounts to DM you hate messages"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "4 clickbait accounts to create highlight reels from promotional videos"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "* All videos and messages will be deleted upon service conclusion"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7a6f07cbf831d770"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Full Immersion | 3-Day Celebrity Experience | 888,000 Credits Only"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(Includes Lite Experience package content)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-81bde2d52ed14968"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Hype Squad: Provides a hype atmosphere at three locations, including airports and hotels"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5b6732acc9c920e0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
